gtars-rgblast includes a Rust port of parts of NCBI BLAST+ 2.17.0:

- the nucleotide search core (`algo/blast/core`), in `src/engine/`;
- the symmetric DUST masker (`algo/dustmask/symdust.cpp`), in `src/engine/dust.rs`;
- the `CRandom` generator (`util/random_gen.cpp`), in `src/convert/random.rs`;
- the query batching rule of the blastn application (`app/blast/blast_app_util.hpp`), in
  `src/engine/search.rs`.

It also writes BLAST version 5 databases that are byte-identical to those of `makeblastdb`
(`src/blastdb/`). Each module header names the NCBI source file it follows.

